  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;The submitted revisions have failed to adequately address concerns regarding the height of the development. By reason of its excessive height, the proposed development would appear unduly prominent, bulky and visually intrusive within the street scene, resulting in a form of development that is out of character with the surrounding area. The proposal would cause unacceptable harm to the character, appearance and visual amenity of the locality, contrary to Policy GR1 of the New Local Plan (2021-2041), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), and the National Planning Policy Framework (2026).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
